{"id":"31.5.6.1","doc":"T","title":"Single Filter Mode","words":92,"blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":1,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Single Filter Mode is enabled by setting the "},{"t":"field","v":"TWAI_RX_FILTER_MODE"},{"t":"text","v":" bit to 1."}]},{"n":2,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"This will cause the "},{"t":"num","v":"32-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" code and mask values to define a single filter."}]},{"n":3,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The single filter can filter the following bits of a data or remote frame:"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":4,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"SFF"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":5,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The entire "},{"t":"num","v":"11-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" ID"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":6,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"RTR bit"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":7,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Data byte 1 and Data byte 2"}]}]}]]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":8,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"EFF"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":9,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The entire "},{"t":"num","v":"29-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" ID"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":10,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"RTR bit"}]}]}]]}]]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":11,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Figure 31.5-2 illustrates how the "},{"t":"num","v":"32-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" code and mask values will be interpreted under Single Filter Mode."}]}]},{"t":"fig","src":"images/trm-fig-31_5-2.png","alt":"Figure 31.5-2. Single Filter Mode"}]}